[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4829177594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-4829177594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":4829177594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH9dm-g","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T05:09:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T05:09:32Z","body":"just noting that this pr together with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168 would emphasize warnings a bit too much","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4829177594/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4834234051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-4834234051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":4834234051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABICSOww","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T15:28:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T15:28:23Z","body":"> just noting that this pr together with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168 would emphasize warnings a bit too much\r\n\r\nI'm not sure I understand what you mean precisely by \"emphasize a bit too much\". The popup in this PR only appears when the user hovers their cursor over text with a warning or error, and likewise the code actions button from #114168 only appears off to the side when the caret is on a line with code actions available. It would be behavior consistent with VS Code's built-in diagnostic support. Here's a screenshot I took of VS Code while running the code actions PR:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1905\" height=\"269\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-29 at 07 31 21@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb705d2b-3b82-4e87-9e7b-01db889292a2\" />\r\n\r\nThe tooltip describing the warning, as well as documentation if it exists for the symbol, only appears when hovered over, and the code actions lightbulb icon is off to the left side of the code area. (Note that in the future, we may expand code actions to do more than just fix warnings/errors, so that the lightbulb icon may indicate other kinds of improvements/refactoring actions that can be done. As such, the lightbulb does not necessarily indicate a warning.)\r\n\r\nWarning-related features, both already in the engine and submitted as PRs, are independently configurable:\r\n- The code actions lightbulb icon can be disabled via the `text_editor/behavior/code_actions/show_code_actions_button` editor setting.\r\n- Similarly, the underline squiggles in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588 can be effectively disabled by setting the `text_editor/theme/highlighting/warning_underline_color` and/or `text_editor/theme/highlighting/error_underline_color` alpha values to 0.\r\n- The background colors for lines that have warnings and errors is configurable, and also can have their alphas set to 0 to be disabled.\r\n- As of right now there's no editor setting to disable the warning/error text from showing in the hover tooltip, but I think that makes sense to add and will plan on doing so soon.\r\n\r\nWith the line background color for lines with problems already being configurable, I think all of these options will allow users to choose how prominent they want warnings/errors to be.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4834234051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4858622894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-4858622894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":4858622894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIZizrg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T17:49:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T17:49:10Z","body":"The diagnostic tooltips can now be disabled via the editor setting `text_editor/behavior/diagnostics/enable_tooltips`. Additionally, the `EditorHelpBitTooltip::make_tooltip()` method now only accepts a single `diagnostics` parameter, which is BBCode-formatted text to display above the documentation in the tooltip. After the `ScriptTextEditor::_show_symbol_tooltip()` method assembles the lists of warnings and errors, it wraps them in the relevant BBCode `[color]` blocks so that errors are red and warnings are yellow (or whatever the user has set for their error and warning colors).\r\n\r\nThese two changes move logic out of `EditorHelpBitTooltip::make_tooltip()` and make it simpler, but at the expense of making `ScriptTextEditor::_show_symbol_tooltip()` a bit more complex. I've kept the previous version of the PR (with more logic in `_show_symbol_tooltip()`) on a separate branch so we can return to it if we decide we prefer that approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4858622894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5075544690","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5075544690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5075544690,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLoaqcg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T23:29:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T23:29:28Z","body":"As #119588 gets closer to being merged, I wanted to bump this PR, as I think it will pair well with it. These two PRs together will make for some nice enhancements to the Script Editor experience, in my opinion 🙂 \r\n\r\nFurthermore, once #119588 is merged, I should be able to update this PR so that the warning/error information only appears when hovering over the specific portion of a line producing the warning/error, which more closely matches the behavior found in other IDEs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5075544690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5081729230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5081729230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5081729230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLuUIzg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T03:03:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T03:03:48Z","body":"I've now updated the PR so that the hover position within the line is taken into consideration when displaying warnings and errors in the tooltip. For example, here you can see that the error message only shows up when hovering over the part of the line that is actually producing the error:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b56f3fbf-7372-40fa-a18d-bbaf766f1ba4\r\n\r\nWhile testing this, I did come across an issue with the current implementation. The tooltip is specifically displayed when the user hovers over a _symbol_, not just any character in the line (including punctuation or whitespace). As a result, in some cases it's easy for the user to try hovering over a warning and not receive any tooltip for it:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecbff8fa-fecc-4c3a-bad2-52d5e0e61d03\r\n\r\nIt seems to me like a proper fix could be tricky without breaking compatibility to some extent, as the `symbol_hovered` signal in `CodeEdit` would need to be emitted even when a character that isn't considered a \"symbol\" is hovered. I have a few ideas on how I might approach this but am not sure what would be best:\r\n- Introduce a new signal, something like `text_hovered`, that doesn't require a symbol to be under the cursor. Look up the currently-hovered symbol through other methods for the doc tooltip information, rather than relying on what was passed through the signal.\r\n- Change `symbol_hovered` so it emits for punctuation and whitespace. Possibly add a second argument to it that indicates whether the hovering was above an actual symbol; if true, for example, it would match the current behavior.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know how you think this would best be accomplished!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5081729230/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083602696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5083602696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5083602696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLwGfCA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T13:07:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T13:07:28Z","body":"I don't think we can add optional params to signals without breaking compat, so we shouldn't change `symbol_hovered`.\r\n\r\nUsing a `text_hovered` signal would basically be triggered from mouse motion, we could just check for mouse motion in `ScriptTextEditor::_text_edit_gui_input` instead and start a timer there.\r\n\r\nIdeally this would work for shaders and json files too, but we may want to unify the warning/error system first between them all.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083602696/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5084324091","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5084324091","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5084324091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLwyg-w","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T05:13:46Z","body":"Thanks for the suggestion! This morning, I tried copying and modifying the code from CodeEdit to ScriptTextEditor. It now has its own timer system, and can detect hovering over symbols to display their documentation just as before, as well as hovering over any part of a warning/error to show its message:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfe42455-2030-4fee-87fb-7c4198a383ce\r\n\r\n~~For some reason in this test, I noticed that hovering over line 36, despite having a warning underline/highlight, does not display an associated warning message. The list of warning _does_ say that there's a warning regarding `THE_LIST` on line 36, so I'll have to investigate that further tonight...~~\n\nFound the bug causing this! I have a fix for it now, but unfortunately my home internet is down and my computer isn't willing to use my phone's hotspot, so I'll have to wait on pushing it until the internet comes back 😦 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5084324091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5170704399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5170704399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5170704399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNDKwDw","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T19:17:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T19:17:09Z","body":"Thanks so much for the testing, reviews, and approval!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5170704399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5330459820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5330459820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5330459820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPbhcrA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T15:34:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T15:34:24Z","body":"- After https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121311, the symbol tooltip code needs to be updated to match.\r\nCodeEdit may need a public method to get the code completion rect or something.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5330459820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331859678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5331859678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5331859678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPc243g","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T17:38:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T17:38:18Z","body":"Thank you for the heads up about that! The changes to this PR should now incorporate the behavior in the PR you linked, so that:\r\n- Pressing a key cancels the tooltip timer (`script_text_editor.cpp:2506`)\r\n- The mouse has to be moved and then stopped for the tooltip timer to begin (`script_text_editor.cpp:2499`)\r\n- If the mouse is hovering over the code completion popup and _also_ a symbol/diagnostic, it won't display the tooltip (`script_text_editor.cpp:2722`)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331859678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5358919453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5358919453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5358919453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP2qfHQ","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T16:42:21Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T18:02:02Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122657\r\nHow about having a small indicator showing whether the diagnostic is an Error or Warning, along with a copy button? The popup could follow the existing documentation tooltip style and reuse the same copy button/icon used in the documentation.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1105\" height=\"539\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-20 184644\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e2f378c-218f-457d-b53d-4d2bfe9ad541\" />\r\n<img width=\"947\" height=\"496\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-20 184656\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0c068de-5805-4b80-a2d3-a1188c47cba8\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/539bae3f-7c52-4449-970a-b4c1010c1948\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe existing tool tip can be below it to make sure no info is ommited. \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5358919453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359848578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5359848578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5359848578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP3jMgg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T18:08:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T18:08:59Z","body":"@shiva-kar I think those would be helpful features to have (especially the copy button), but given that this PR has been approved and is queued up for 4.8, I don't want to reset its progress by adding significant additional functionality. I think it'll be best to add things like the copy button and the icon in a follow-up PR.\r\n\r\nNote that currently, the text is colored according to the warning and error colors depending on if it's describing a warning or an error:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-08-20 at 11 07 52@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54645683-3797-446b-bcd4-9d1a78c8b95f\" />\r\n\r\nThis is likely less helpful for colorblind people, so I still think the icons are a good idea, but at the least for most users, they will be able to tell which diagnostics are warnings versus errors.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359848578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360003293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5360003293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5360003293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP3so3Q","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T18:23:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T21:00:41Z","body":"@Meorge Thanks for the response. Since my PR can't be merged as a new contributor, I mainly wanted to make sure the idea and implementation don't get lost.\r\n\r\nMy implementation was also based on the existing approach in this PR, so if you decide to do a follow-up PR for the icon and copy button, feel free to refer to #122657 / my repo for anything that might be useful.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"529\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 022800\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac97e590-7a59-4dc9-8281-e0a9a926af64\" />\r\n<img width=\"933\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 022807\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e87e8d9-79c5-4f73-9bda-39bc9e0a7791\" />\r\n<img width=\"1062\" height=\"331\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 022823\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c525d6c-4734-4507-8e91-fb02fbd5d7f6\" />\r\n<img width=\"785\" height=\"431\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 022841\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcf06c7a-d2ff-4730-8e5d-e8a02e809293\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5360003293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5371857950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5371857950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5371857950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQDAMHg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T15:24:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T15:24:55Z","body":"@shiva-kar Discussing it with maintainers on the RocketChat, it sounds like the best next step would be to file a proposal specifically for the additional behavior (copy button, ignore button, icon). There may be a few things to discuss regarding them outside of a concrete implementation (i.e., a PR) before we start working on one.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5371857950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372812998","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5372812998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5372812998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQD6exg","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T16:57:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:57:05Z","body":"@Meorge Thanks for following up and discussing it in the chat.. I will go ahead and open a proposal on godot-proposals detailing the severity icons/ copy button and ignore action so we can discuss the design there and wanted changes that maybe needed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372812998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5373095012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5373095012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5373095012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQELsZA","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T17:25:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T17:25:00Z","body":"@Meorge Just wanted to drop a quick update I have submitted the proposal on godot-proposals.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15415\r\n\r\nAlso regarding my reference branch ..my implementation was heavily inspired by your work here. I actually didn't pull your branch directly because I wasn't entirely sure how to pull an unmerged upstream PR to my local fork. Instead I just looked through the files you changed to understand the logic and then built my modifications based on that.\r\n\r\nThe main difference in my implementation is how the tooltip is constructed. Since `RichTextLabel` doesn't easily support interactive UI buttons, I changed `make_tooltip` to accept a `Control*` instead of a string. This let me build an `HBoxContainer` in `_show_symbol_tooltip` to hold the severity icon, title, and the actual `Button` nodes for Copy and Ignore, and then pass that whole container into the tooltip header.\r\n\r\nWhenever we get around to the follow up PR if the proposal gets interest, feel free to grab any of that container logic from my branch if it makes adding the buttons easier. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5373095012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5532354965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120726#issuecomment-5532354965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120726","id":5532354965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABScEJlQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url